                                                "sense_id": "f1fd4f2f-b583-3856-884b-09bc849de89b",
                                                "text": "desk tidy; sink tidy; cable tidy"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27e882c0-76d2-4b91-8f12-0085d5cb72a0",
                                                "sense_id": "f1fd4f2f-b583-3856-884b-09bc849de89b",
                                                "text": "It was in the days when[…]every scrap of cotton or linen found its way into the ‘tidy’."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7b8716a-2e8e-4b59-84d3-25db38cb5b77",
                                                "sense_id": "f1fd4f2f-b583-3856-884b-09bc849de89b",
                                                "text": "NORRIS'S SINK TIDY. J NORRIS AND SONS, Sunningdale, near Ascot, the inventors of the \"Little Friend\" soap-tray, have extended the usefulness of this utensil by designing a sink-tidy for carrying three of the trays in the manner shown in the engraving. The tidy is formed by a strip of light wood[…]The price at which the tidy is offered virtually places it within the reach of everyone."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6aab040-e567-4337-a802-4247013edcd0",
                                                "sense_id": "f1fd4f2f-b583-3856-884b-09bc849de89b",
                                                "text": "Inside there it was, the 1337 Revolving Desk Tidy.[…]The round \"tidy\" was divided into six segments \"for all types of small sundries,\" and looked a bit like a grapefruit cut across the middle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
